  "description": "Hoopsy is a bold and playful graffiti drip font inspired by street art, urban culture, and spray-paint lettering. The letters feature thick shapes with dripping ink details that instantly give your design a raw, energetic, and rebellious vibe. This font is perfect for creating eye-catching titles, streetwear designs, posters, music covers, skateboard graphics, graffiti artwork, and urban-themed branding. The playful curves and bold structure make every word look expressive and full of attitude.\nWhether you’re designing for street culture, hip-hop visuals, or edgy creative projects, Hoopsy helps your text stand out and leave a strong visual impact.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Hoopsy is a bold and playful graffiti drip font inspired by street art, urban culture, and spray-paint lettering. The letters feature thick shapes with dripping ink details that instantly give your design a raw, energetic, and rebellious vibe. This font is perfect for creating eye-catching titles, streetwear designs, posters, music covers, skateboard graphics, graffiti artwork, and urban-themed branding. The playful curves and bold structure make every word look expressive and full of attitude.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing for street culture, hip-hop visuals, or edgy creative projects, Hoopsy helps your text stand out and leave a strong visual impact.</p>",
